  "guide.installTitle": "1. Add to Home Screen",
  "guide.installBody": "In Safari on iPhone: Share → \"Add to Home Screen\", then open from the icon.",
  "guide.googleTitle": "2. Connect Google Calendar (optional)",
  "guide.googleBody": "Tab Sync: paste your Google Client ID, tap Connect. No Client ID yet? Create one free at console.cloud.google.com (about 10 minutes) — steps in section B of the included guide.",
  "guide.shortcutTitle": "3. Create the wallpaper Shortcut (once)",
  "guide.shortcutBody": "In Shortcuts app, add a \"Set Wallpaper\" action: Image = Shortcut Input, Lock Screen, \"Show Preview\" off. Name it to match the app's Shortcut name. If it fails with \"extensionKit… error 2\" (an iOS bug), tap \"Set wallpaper\" again.",
  "guide.dailyTitle": "4. Daily use (≤ 3 taps)",
  "guide.dailyBody": "Open the app → Preview tab → tap \"Set wallpaper\". It copies the image and runs the Shortcut. Allow the Shortcut permission the first time.",
  "guide.fallbackTitle": "5. If Google sign-in doesn't return to the app",
  "guide.fallbackBody": "Confirmed working on iPhone 13 Pro Max. If another device gets stuck after sign-in: use LichKhoa in Safari (bookmark it) for Google instead — its data is separate from the installed app.",
  "guide.limitsTitle": "6. Known limits",
  "guide.limitsBody": "Google session lasts 1 hour, tap \"Reconnect\" after. No automatic wallpaper changes. Data may be cleared after 7 days if not installed. For reminders, add each event to iPhone Calendar.",
  "guide.goToSync": "Open Sync tab",
  "guide.goToDesign": "Open Design tab"
